OL,3,GNEWSAGiant tree to be felled after
OL,4,Abranches hit homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents have won their battle to have
OL,7,Fa 140-year-old giant tree felled after
OL,8,Fit repeatedly dropped branches on
OL,9,Fnearby bungalows.
OL,11,FTree owner Jonathan Rickell appealed to
OL,12,Fa government planning inspector after
OL,13,FTelford & Wrekin Council refused
OL,14,Fpermission to remove the wellingtonia,
OL,15,Fwhich dates back to the 1880s.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
