OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAGiant tree to be felled after
OL,4,Abranches hit homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 21m (70ft) tree is protected by a
OL,7,Fpreservation order, and the council
OL,8,Fargued its removal would harm the
OL,9,Farea's appearance. Planning inspector
OL,10,FElaine Benson visited the site on
OL,11,FLindfield Drive in Wellington in
OL,12,FOctober.
OL,14,FShe agreed its removal would harm the
OL,15,Farea's appearance, but this was
OL,16,Foutweighed by the damage caused to
OL,17,Fnearby homes and the risk of more
OL,18,Fdamage from falling branches.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
